sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as TCP client socket
    participant OS
    participant L as Server listening socket
    participant S as Accepted server socket
    C->>OS: connect(server IP, port)
    OS-->>L: Incoming connection after TCP setup
    L->>S: accept() returns connected socket
    C->>S: Ordered byte stream (application frames messages)
    S-->>C: Response bytes
    C->>S: close()
    Note over L,S: Listener remains available for other clients